         "noun"
        ]
       ]
      }
     ],
     "title": "Same meaning, two orders"
    },
    {
     "type": "h",
     "t": "Saying not"
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "To make the negative, place **hindî** (*not* within a sentence, or *no* when used as a response) **before magkaroón**."
    },
    {
     "type": "examples",
     "items": [
